{"5123730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Altstadt", "steam_appid": 5123730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Altstadt is a relaxing building toy about shaping a colorful miniature German old town. Place houses and streets on a compact board and watch a small settlement grow into a detailed diorama. There are no resources, budgets, or populations to manage. Just build, experiment, and refine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/da11e257d48ea26e59e83bee6f5e125a.poster.avif?t=1788067569\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/da11e257d48ea26e59e83bee6f5e125a.webm?t=1788067569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/da11e257d48ea26e59e83bee6f5e125a.mp4?t=1788067569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD HOUSE BY HOUSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with individual houses. Make them taller or lower them again, or expand them into larger connected buildings. Lay streets to form paved squares and intimate courtyards. Entrances, shared walls, and rooflines adapt to the town you build, and eligible lanes can even become covered Schwibbogen passages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/b055547a57937c086b382d3d683afe64.poster.avif?t=1788067569\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/b055547a57937c086b382d3d683afe64.webm?t=1788067569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/b055547a57937c086b382d3d683afe64.mp4?t=1788067569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose coordinated facade and roof colors for each complete building. Renovate a house to try another compatible architectural design without rebuilding the layout you like. Undo and redo let you experiment freely until every corner feels right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD WITHOUT PRESSURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no money, score, timer, objective, or failure state. Chimney smoke, shutters, laundry, greenery, and small movements give your finished streets an inhabited feeling without turning the town into a management simulation. Keep refining one composition or clear the board and begin again.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Altstadt is a relaxing building toy about shaping a colorful miniature German old town. Place houses and streets on a compact board and watch a small settlement grow into a detailed diorama. There are no resources, budgets, or populations to manage. Just build, experiment, and refine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/da11e257d48ea26e59e83bee6f5e125a.poster.avif?t=1788067569\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/da11e257d48ea26e59e83bee6f5e125a.webm?t=1788067569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/da11e257d48ea26e59e83bee6f5e125a.mp4?t=1788067569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD HOUSE BY HOUSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with individual houses. Make them taller or lower them again, or expand them into larger connected buildings. Lay streets to form paved squares and intimate courtyards. Entrances, shared walls, and rooflines adapt to the town you build, and eligible lanes can even become covered Schwibbogen passages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/b055547a57937c086b382d3d683afe64.poster.avif?t=1788067569\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/b055547a57937c086b382d3d683afe64.webm?t=1788067569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123730/extras/b055547a57937c086b382d3d683afe64.mp4?t=1788067569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose coordinated facade and roof colors for each complete building. Renovate a house to try another compatible architectural design without rebuilding the layout you like. Undo and redo let you experiment freely until every corner feels right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD WITHOUT PRESSURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no money, score, timer, objective, or failure state. Chimney smoke, shutters, laundry, greenery, and small movements give your finished streets an inhabited feeling without turning the town into a management simulation. Keep refining one composition or clear the board and begin again.</p>", "short_description": "Build a colorful miniature German old town, one house and street at a time. Make houses taller, expand them into larger connected buildings, and lay streets to form squares and courtyards. Repaint and renovate your compact diorama without management, timers, or failure.", "supported_languages": "English, French, 